n like F.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/21.svg","Fw'","The 2 front layers together: a quarter turn like F'.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/20.svg","Fw","The 2 front layers together (F + 2F): a quarter turn like F.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/19.svg","Dw","The 2 bottom layers together (D + 2D): a quarter turn like D.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/18.svg","2U'","Only the 2nd layer from the top: a quarter turn like U'.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/17.svg","2U","Only the 2nd layer from the top: a quarter turn like U.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/16.svg","Uw'","The 2 top layers together: a quarter turn like U'.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/14.svg","Uw","The 2 top layers together (U + 2U): a quarter turn like U.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/13.svg","2L'","Only the 2nd layer from the left: a quarter turn like L'.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/12.svg","2L","Only the 2nd layer from the left: a quarter turn like L.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/11.svg","Lw'","The 2 left layers together: a quarter turn like L'.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/10.svg","Lw","The 2 left layers together (L + 2L): a quarter turn like L.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/9.svg","3Rw","The 3 right layers together (everything but L): a quarter turn like R.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/8.svg","2R'","Only the 2nd layer from the right: a quarter turn like R'.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/6.svg","2R","Only the 2nd layer from the right (the inner one, without the outer one): a quarter turn like R.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/5.svg","Rw'","The 2 right layers together: a quarter turn counterclockwise.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/3.svg","Rw","The 2 right layers together (R + 2R): a quarter turn clockwise. Also written r.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/2.svg","R","Outer right layer, as on the 3x3. On the 4x4, from the outside in: R, 2R, 3R and the outer one on the other side (L).","/imagens/notacao/4x4/1.svg",{"_140":141,"_142":143,"_144":145,"_15":146},"id","reducao","nome","Reduction","nivel","iniciante",[147,148],"OLL Parity","PLL Parity","resolucao","cronometro","reconhecimento","4x4","endereco","/4x4/",{"_156":157,"_1